From 8ba8dca588b7422b2624484b60dce008251d7c93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mingmingzhichu <lihaoyu0717@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 16:36:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] drm/panel: add Samsung SOFEF03F M FHD DSC panel

Add a driver for the 1080x2400 command mode AMOLED panel used on the OnePlus
7T.  The init sequence, PPS payload and DSC parameters are taken verbatim from
the vendor device tree node.

The backlight is driven through DCS 0x51.  Its curve is very steep (1024, half
of the 2047 maximum, is barely visible), so the default is full scale, and the
value is pushed from ->enable() because the backlight core only calls
->update_status() when userspace changes it.

The first DSI command burst after power-on occasionally times out, leaving the
panel uninitialised behind a lit but black screen; retry the init sequence with
a power cycle up to three times.
---
